Third-party tools and models
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Velyos Deck integrates with third-party command-line tools and machine-learning
models that are NOT part of this repository and are NOT redistributed with it.
They are installed separately by the user. Their licenses and service terms may
impose additional obligations. See docs/SBOM.md and docs/MODELS.md.

Notable obligations:

- ffmpeg: invoked as an external process. Standard distributions are licensed
  under the GNU LGPL v2.1+ (some builds are GPL). Velyos Deck does not bundle
  ffmpeg; users install it themselves. If you redistribute a bundle that
  includes ffmpeg, you must comply with the ffmpeg license of that build.

- Demucs / Torch and AudioSR model weights carry their own licenses; users
  download them on explicit opt-in (see docs/MODELS.md). These features are
  optional and marked experimental.

- shazamio wraps the proprietary Shazam service API; its use is subject to
  Shazam's terms. This feature is optional and marked experimental.

